&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Site Reliability Engineer II on the Kafka team, you&#39;ll build and operate the software and infrastructure behind one of Vinted&#39;s busiest platforms. The Kafka platform spans multiple data centers and regions across the EU and US, 1000+ Kafka brokers across multiple clusters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll develop Kafka as a managed service, automation and client libraries, primarily using Go, Ruby and Java. You&#39;ll take ownership of solutions throughout their lifecycle: from technical design and implementation to deployment and production operation, and help shape the team&#39;s technical direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role balances systems design, backend development, infrastructure setup maintenance, and operations. It suits an experienced, hands-on engineer who wants to work on large-scale infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
